# Production Archive Creation - Quick Guide

## Overview

This script creates **4 production-ready ZIP archives** of your source code, excluding non-essential directories.

---

## 🚀 Quick Start

### Option 1: Run Full Backup Script (Recommended)

```bash
cd "/Users/user/Documents/FingerMobile Protocol Communication/FingerMobile Protocol"
./create_production_archives.sh
```

**What it does:**
- ✅ Verifies Git repository is clean
- ✅ Creates 4 ZIP archives in `backups/` directory
- ✅ Excludes: node_modules, .git, dist, build, media, assets, logs, caches
- ✅ Shows progress and file sizes
- ✅ Verifies archive integrity

