## 🎯 Direct Commands (Alternative to Script)

If you prefer to run commands manually:

### Command 1: Combined Archive
```bash
cd "/Users/user/Documents/FingerMobile Protocol Communication/FingerMobile Protocol"
zip -r backups/ORMUS_ESMS_Main_Production_03072026.zip \
    apps/backend/src/ \
    apps/frontend-main/src/ \
    -x "*/node_modules/*" \
    -x "*/.git/*" \
    -x "*/dist/*" \
    -x "*/build/*" \
    -x "*/.next/*" \
    -x "*/media/*" \
    -x "*/assets/*" \
    -x "*.log" \
    -x "*.tmp" \
    -x ".DS_Store" \
    -x "__pycache__/*"
```

