## ⚠️ Important Notes

### What's INCLUDED:
✅ TypeScript source files (.ts)  
✅ JavaScript source files (.js)  
✅ Configuration files in src/  
✅ Component files  
✅ Service files  
✅ Controller files  
✅ Model definitions  

### What's EXCLUDED:
❌ node_modules/ (dependencies)  
❌ .git/ (version control history)  
❌ dist/ (build output)  
❌ build/ (build output)  
❌ .next/ (Next.js output)  
❌ media/ (media files)  
❌ assets/ (static assets)  
❌ uploads/ (user uploads)  
❌ *.log (log files)  
❌ *.tmp (temporary files)  
❌ __pycache__/ (Python cache)  

